{"availability":"available","full":"pravnyadv/habitrack","name":"habitrack","description":"Track habits you want to build and things you want to quit. Quit streaks count up on their own until you log a slip. Multi-profile, syncs live across devices.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-17T05:17:35Z","updated":"2026-08-04T19:55:43Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://habitrack-6yj.pages.dev/profile/demo","topics":["astro","cloudflare-workers","habit-tracker","neon-postgres","preact","pwa","realtime","tailwindcss"],"demo":"https://habitrack-6yj.pages.dev/profile/demo","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:43.192Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:43.192Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:43.192Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T05:44:43.192Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A personal habit tracker, built as a cleaner take on beaverhabits. Multiple profiles, realtime sync across devices, installable as a PWA. Runs on Cloudflare Pages with a Neon Postgres backend.","Try the demo: No signup, no login. It loads sample habits and the whole app works: add, edit, delete, reorder, check in, and the Overview screen with the stats and heatmaps. Your changes are kept in your browser's localStorage and never reach the server, so you can't touch anyone's real data. Reset puts the sample data back."],"features":["Two tracker types. A habit is checked off on each scheduled day. A streak works in reverse: it's for quitting things, so every day counts as clean from the start date and you only log the days you slipped. A quit streak…","Per-habit schedules. Each habit picks its own weekdays. Days off aren't counted as missed and streaks skip over them. Days before a habit started are never counted either.","Multiple profiles. Each profile has its own passcode and habits. Anyone with the URL can create one. The first profile is admin and can manage the others.","View-only sharing. You can invite another profile to watch your data for accountability. The recipient has to accept, and access is strictly read-only: mutating endpoints ignore the ?profile= parameter entirely, so a…","Public profiles. A profile can opt into being readable by anyone at /p/, with no login at all. The profile picker badges each row Private or Public, and public rows open straight into a read-only view. Only the owner…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pravnyadv/habitrack/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e891b54b3292c537c120556aaf00c6505f0730ee60c2a39e6fb458bc45192b9e","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:43.349Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:43.349Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A personal habit tracker, built as a cleaner take on beaverhabits. Multiple profiles, realtime sync across devices, installable as a PWA. Runs on Cloudflare Pages with a Neon Postgres backend.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pravnyadv/habitrack/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Try the demo: No signup, no login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pravnyadv/habitrack/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"A profile can opt into being readable by anyone at /p/, with no login at all.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pravnyadv/habitrack/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e891b54b3292c537c120556aaf00c6505f0730ee60c2a39e6fb458bc45192b9e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pravnyadv/habitrack/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:43.350Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-04T19:55:43Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pravnyadv/habitrack/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:43.350Z","hash":"e891b54b3292c537c120556aaf00c6505f0730ee60c2a39e6fb458bc45192b9e","originalBytes":13389,"storedBytes":13389,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["profile","npm","demo","run","a